# Plan data for tests/modules/upgrade/test_plan_render.sh - a follow with no gap at all.
#
# The shape the three gate propositions produce when they all pass (design.md §5): the count
# line has nothing to hold back, no gap group is printed, and the block still ends with the
# question. A renderer that always prints a header, or that prints `(0)` for a group nobody
# reported, fails here.
section Update
row base 25.12.2 -> 25.12.2
row kernel 6.12.87 -> 6.12.87
row platform 0.0.12 -> 0.0.13
row Tested YES - patch range covered in CI
row Risk LOW - same base, only the platform layer moves

section Packages
row follow 8 to follow, 0 held back, 0 replay from local copies
row gate feeds answer, every constraint solves, no local copies to judge

section Config
row files 0 files differ from their package

note apk keeps your configuration; nothing here changes it.
count 8
